# Skill rules

- `skills/` and `skills.manifest.json` are declarative. Never `eval`, `require`, or execute skill files.
- Load only the selected `SKILL.md` prompt. Do not inject every skill prompt into every turn.
- Manifest permissions are requirements, not grants. Tools still come from the Tool Registry.
- Validate paths so they remain under `skills/<id>/SKILL.md`.
- Fail closed on a malformed pack: load nothing rather than a partial unsafe set.
- Record the skill id in audit events. Do not log skill prompts or user secrets.

```text
User → Orchestrator → Skill Router → selected prompt
                         ↓
                   Tool Registry → Policy Engine → approval → tool
```
